			"x": 94,
			"y": 1380,
			"width": 386.71875,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "  Render N    →  useEffect fires\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  triggered  (state / props change)\n      ↓\n  Render N    →  cleanup runs  ← STALE: Render N values\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  runs\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  new useEffect fires",
			"originalText": "  Render N    →  useEffect fires\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  triggered  (state / props change)\n      ↓\n  Render N    →  cleanup runs  ← STALE: Render N values\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  runs\n      ↓\n  Render N+1  →  new useEffect fires",
